./docs/articles/new-expensify/connections/netsuite/Configure-Netsuite.md:10:The following section will help you determine how data will be imported from NetSuite into Expensify. To change your import settings, navigate to the Accounting settings for your workspace, then click **Import** under the NetSuite connection.
./docs/articles/new-expensify/connections/sage-intacct/Configure-Sage-Intacct.md:11:To select or change the Sage Intacct entity that your Expensify workspace is connected to, navigate to the Accounting settings for your workspace and click **Entity** under the Sage Intacct connection.
