./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connect-credit-cards/company-cards/Troubleshooting.md:55:When your online bank/card account password has been changed, you may need to update the details on the Expensify end as well. To do this, navigate to *Settings* > *Domain* > _[Domain Name]_ > *Company Cards* and click _Fix Card_.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connect-credit-cards/company-cards/Troubleshooting.md:86:- Have the employee navigate to their Settings > Your Account > Credit Card Import and confirm that their card is only listed once.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/expensify-billing/Change-Plan-Or-Subscription.md:31:1. In the Expensify mobile app, navigate to **Settings > Workspaces > [Your Workspace] > Current Plan > Switch**.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/netsuite/Netsuite-Troubleshooting.md:90:   - To find this in Expensify navigate to **Settings > Workspaces > Workspace Name > Connections > Configure**.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/netsuite/Netsuite-Troubleshooting.md:210:1. In NetSuite, navigate to Setup > Accounting > Accounting Preferences.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/netsuite/Netsuite-Troubleshooting.md:230:1. In NetSuite, navigate to Lists > Relationships > Vendors to access the list of Vendors.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/netsuite/Netsuite-Troubleshooting.md:316:   - In NetSuite, navigate to Setup > Integrations > Manage Integrations.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/netsuite/Netsuite-Troubleshooting.md:426:1. In NetSuite, navigate to Setup > Company > Enable Features.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/Greenhouse.md:17:1. Log into Expensify as a Workspace admin and navigate to **Settings > Workspaces > _[Workspace Name]_ > Connections**
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/Greenhouse.md:22:1. Click the link under Step 1 on the Greenhouse Integration instructions page, or log into your Greenhouse account and navigate to **Configure > Dev Center > Web Hooks > Web Hooks**.
./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/Greenhouse.md:27:1. Click the link under Step 2 on the Greenhouse Integration instructions page, or log into your Greenhouse account and navigate to **Configure > Custom Options > Custom Company Fields > Candidates**
