./docs/articles/expensify-classic/connections/sage-intacct/Configure-Sage-Intacct.md:98:Now, in Expensify, navigate to **Settings > Workspaces > Group > [Workspace Name] > Connections**, and click **Configure** under Sage Intacct. On the Coding tab, enable the toggle next to User Defined Dimensions. Enter the "Integration name" and choose whether to import it into Expensify as an expense-level Tag or as a Report Field, then click **Save**.
